---
// Intentionally hardcoded – swap to a CMS field when ready.
---

<section class="video-showcase-section" id="kajian-pilihan" aria-label="Kajian Visual & Multimedia">
  <div class="video-showcase-box">
    <div class="video-player-container">
      <iframe
        src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/gBDRoNfvOTo"
        title="Pemerkosaan dalam Pernikahan: Apakah Pernikahan Menghapus Persetujuan?"
        loading="lazy"
        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
        allowfullscreen
      ></iframe>
    </div>

    <div class="video-info-container">
      <div class="video-badge-tag">
        <span class="badge-category-mini">Perempuan & Keadilan</span>
        <span class="badge-tag-pill">Podcast PKUMI</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="video-title">
        Pemerkosaan dalam Pernikahan: Apakah Pernikahan Menghapus Persetujuan?
      </h2>

      <div class="video-speaker-byline">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
             stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
             stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M12 2a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v7a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V5a3 3 0 0 0-3-3Z"/>
          <path d="M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2"/>
          <line x1="12" y1="19" x2="12" y2="22"/>
        </svg>
        <span>Putri Arofah &amp; Nirmala Sari (Host: Fahmia Nuha Tsabita)</span>
      </div>

      <p class="video-synopsis">
        Mengupas fenomena marital rape dari perspektif etika relasi Qur'ani,
        tinjauan UU PKDRT No. 23/2004, serta dekonstruksi stigma sosial atas
        penafsiran hadits pemenuhan hak suami-istri.
      </p>

      <div class="video-cta-group">
        <a href="/videos" class="btn-video-all">
          <span>Lihat Semua Video Podcast →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .video-showcase-section { margin-bottom: var(--spacing-16); }

  .video-showcase-box {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 55% 45%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue-900) 0%, var(--blue-950) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(52, 198, 244, 0.25);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--spacing-8);
    gap: var(--spacing-8);
    align-items: center;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .video-player-container {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    background: #000;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .video-player-container iframe {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0;
    width: 100%; height: 100%;
    border: 0;
  }

  .video-info-container { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

  .video-badge-tag {
    display: flex; align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2);
  }

  .badge-category-mini {
    font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--sky-300);
  }

  .badge-tag-pill {
    font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    background: rgba(52, 198, 244, 0.15);
    color: var(--sky-300);
    border: 1px solid rgba(52, 198, 244, 0.3);
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  .video-title {
    font-size: 1.45rem; line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-3);
  }

  .video-speaker-byline {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--sky-300);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-3);
  }

  .video-synopsis {
    font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--sky-100); opacity: 0.9;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-6);
  }

  .btn-video-all {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center;
    font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--gold-400);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast), transform var(--transition-fast);
  }
  .btn-video-all:hover {
    color: var(--gold-500);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .video-showcase-box { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .video-title { font-size: 1.2rem; }
  }
</style>